1	[![MseeP.ai Security Assessment Badge](https://mseep.net/pr/flankerhqd-jebmcp-badge.png)](https://mseep.ai/app/flankerhqd-jebmcp)
2	
3	A quick-and-dirty MCP server&Plugin for JEB Pro.
4	Tested on Cline & Cursor & RooCode.
5	
6	Reference: https://github.com/mrexodia/ida-pro-mcp
7	
8	# Installation
9	
10	## Requirements
11	```
12	Python >= 3.11
13	uv: https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/
14	```
15	## Usage
16	- COPY the src/jeb_mcp/MCP.py to $JEB_INSTALLATION_DIR/scripts. Make sure the jython file is also present
17	- Choose and Start the script in JEB GUI (`File->Scripts->Scripts selector...`), check for desired output:
18	```bash
19	[MCP] Plugin loaded
20	[MCP] Plugin running
21	[MCP] Server started at http://127.0.0.1:16161
22	```
23	- Add this MCP server's config in cline/cursor/etc, as in the sample
24	
25	# 安装
26	要求：
27	```
28	安装 python3.11及以上版本
29	安装 uv https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/
30	```
31	
32	# RooCode 使用方法：
33	
34	1. 使用 vscode 打开该工具，此时目录结构如下：
35	
36	```bash
37	.
38	├── README.md
39	├── jeb-mcp
40	│   ├── pyproject.toml
41	│   ├── src
42	│   │   └── jeb_mcp
43	│   │       ├── MCP.py
44	│   │       ├── server.py
45	│   │       └── server_generated.py
46	│   └── uv.lock
47	└── sample_cline_mcp_settings.json
48	```
49	
50	2. 点击左侧活动栏 rooCode 图标，然后继续点击 RooCode 对话框右上角 `...`，最后点击编辑项目 MCP 按钮，
51	   会在当前目录下产生一个 `.roo` 目录，其中包含 `mcp.json` 文件。
52	
53	![](assets/2025-08-26-10-03-53.png)
54	
55	3. 修改 `mcp.json` 文件为下列内容：
56	
57	```json
58	{
59	  "mcpServers": {
60	    "jeb": {
61	      "command": "uv",
62	      "args": ["--directory", "jeb-mcp/src/jeb_mcp", "run", "server.py"],
63	      "timeout": 1800,
64	      "disabled": false,
65	      "autoApprove": [
66	        "ping",
67	        "check_connection",
68	        "get_manifest",
69	        "get_all_exported_activities",
70	        "get_exported_activities_count",
71	        "get_an_exported_activity_by_index",
72	        "get_class_decompiled_code",
73	        "get_method_decompiled_code",
74	        "get_method_overrides",
75	        "get_method_callers",
76	        "get_superclass",
77	        "get_interfaces",
78	        "get_class_methods",
79	        "get_class_fields",
80	        "rename_class_name",
81	        "rename_method_name",
82	        "rename_field_name"
83	      ],
84	      "alwaysAllow": [
85	        "check_connection",
86	        "get_class_decompiled_code",
87	        "get_class_fields",
88	        "ping",
89	        "get_manifest",
90	        "get_all_exported_activities",
91	        "get_exported_activities_count",
92	        "get_an_exported_activity_by_index",
93	        "get_method_decompiled_code",
94	        "get_method_callers",
95	        "get_method_overrides",
96	        "get_superclass",
97	        "get_interfaces",
98	        "get_class_methods",
99	        "rename_class_name",
100	        "rename_method_name",
101	        "rename_class_field"
102	      ]
103	    }
104	  }
105	}
106	```
107	
108	此时可以发现 mcp 服务器列表中已经存在 jeb mcp 服务器了。
109	
110	4. 打开 jeb 菜单栏 `File->Scripts->Scripts selector...` 选中当前目录下 `jeb-mcp/src/jeb_mcp/MCP.py` 文件，
111	   运行脚本，此时可以在 jeb 的 logger 窗口中看到如下输出：
112	
113	```bash
114	[MCP] Plugin loaded
115	[MCP] Plugin running
116	[MCP] Server started at http://127.0.0.1:16161
117	```
118	
119	5. 在 RooCode 对话框中输入下列相应的任务即可，如：
120	```bash
121	1. 连接MCP JEB
122	2. 分析D:\xxx.apk 应用的 Lnet/xxx/MainActivity; 类的功能
123	3. 根据功能重命名所有方法名小于3个字符的名称
124	4. 如果调用了其他类的方法，分析相应的类功能，并重命名方法名小于3个字符的名称
125	5. 输出分析过程
126	```
127	
128	
